\nAll changes are in `src/sensei_top/logs.py`:\n- **New `_Level` filter:** it passes records at its floor and up. Below the floor it passes only INFO and up from `sensei_top.llm` or `sensei_top.llm.*`. A name like `sensei_top.llmx` does not pass.\n- **Console handler:** now set to INFO, with a `_Level` filter at ERROR (WARNING with `--verbose`).\n- **File handler:** now set to INFO (DEBUG with `--verbose`). Without `--verbose`, a WARNING-floor `_Level` filter is added after the header line is written, so the header still gets through.\n- **Module docstring:** the \"Levels\" bullet now says both handlers also take `sensei_top.llm`'s INFO lines.\n\nI haven't done the scratch-`--db` verification run from AGENTS.md, so I haven't watched a real generate call print its cost line.", "ttft_ms": 1851, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 13682, "uuid": "ac59c0fb-5fed-4e33-9e65-1c9321bcb304", "ttft_stream_ms": 1139, "time_to_request_ms": 56, "first_content_frame_ms": 1139, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
